  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the production and marketing capabilities with a rights based approach of vulnerable rural populations in southern Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Educacin, Capacitacin y Tecnologa Campesina (CECTEC), $37,350 over one year CECTEC will work in six rural communities whose residents were resettled pursuant to Paraguay&apos;s agrarian reform program. It will offer these farmers training and technical assistance toward identifying their development priorities and improving their output and marketing of organic products. The project is expected to benefit 250 families in the department of Itapa.</narrative>
  </description>
